swimlane-beta TB
  accTitle: Incident response
  accDescr: The on-call engineer is paged, acknowledges and assesses severity. A SEV1 or SEV2 goes to the incident lead, who opens a war room and assigns a comms owner; the comms owner posts status updates until the lead declares the incident resolved, then the lead writes the postmortem. Lower severities the on-call engineer fixes alone.
  subgraph oncall [On-call engineer]
    paged([Get paged])
    ack[Acknowledge]
    sev{SEV1 or SEV2?}:::key
    fix[Fix it alone]
  end
  subgraph lead [Incident lead]
    room[Open a war room]
    assign[Assign a comms owner]
    resolved[Declare resolved]
    postmortem[Write the postmortem]
  end
  subgraph comms [Comms owner]
    updates[Post status updates]
  end
  paged --> ack --> sev
  sev -->|yes| room
  sev -->|no| fix
  room --> assign --> updates
  updates -->|until resolved| resolved
  resolved --> postmortem
